---
// Tactical Methodology Component (Standardized across Home & About pages)
---
<section id="approach" class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-white/10 w-full mb-12">
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-20 flex flex-col items-center text-center w-full">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <p class="font-mono text-brand-primary tracking-[0.2em] text-sm mb-4 uppercase">/// OPERATIONAL PHASES</p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4 text-white uppercase">The Tactical Approach.</h2>
            <p class="text-brand-light/60 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
                Our phased deployment system designed to isolate competitors and systematically capture market share.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CSS Grid Match to Projects.astro / Services -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Phase 1 -->
        <div class="group relative bg-[#020202] border border-white/10 transition-all duration-500 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-brand-primary flex flex-col justify-between h-full bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:1rem_1rem]">
            <div>
                <p class="font-mono text-brand-primary/60 tracking-widest text-xs mb-6 uppercase group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors border-b border-white/5 pb-4 w-full">PHASE 01</p>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white uppercase mb-4 tracking-tight">Audit <br/><span class="text-brand-primary/50">&</span> Teardown.</h3>
                <p class="text-brand-light/60 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">We deeply analyze your complete digital footprint, identify where leads are slipping through the cracks, and reverse-engineer your competitors' weaknesses.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-12 font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-primary/40 uppercase tracking-widest group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">>>> INITIALIZING</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 2 -->
        <div class="group relative bg-[#020202] border border-white/10 transition-all duration-500 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-brand-primary flex flex-col justify-between h-full bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:1rem_1rem]">
            <div>
                <p class="font-mono text-brand-primary/60 tracking-widest text-xs mb-6 uppercase group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors border-b border-white/5 pb-4 w-full">PHASE 02</p>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white uppercase mb-4 tracking-tight">Rebuild <br/><span class="text-brand-primary/50">&</span> Refactor.</h3>
                <p class="text-brand-light/60 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">We rebuild your digital infrastructure for pure performance. The strategy flexes to your needs: deploying custom websites, optimizing SEO, or refactoring ads.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-12 font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-primary/40 uppercase tracking-widest group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">>>> COMPILING</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 3 -->
        <div class="group relative bg-[#020202] border border-white/10 transition-all duration-500 p-10 lg:p-12 hover:border-brand-primary flex flex-col justify-between h-full bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:1rem_1rem]">
            <div>
                <p class="font-mono text-brand-primary/60 tracking-widest text-xs mb-6 uppercase group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors border-b border-white/5 pb-4 w-full">PHASE 03</p>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white uppercase mb-4 tracking-tight">Drive <br/><span class="text-brand-primary/50">&</span> Scale.</h3>
                <p class="text-brand-light/60 font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">Once the foundation is hardened, we detonate growth. Through localized SEO and targeted Paid Ads, we drive high-intent regional traffic straight into your new conversion engine.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-12 font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-primary/40 uppercase tracking-widest group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">>>> EXECUTING</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
